        "correct": false,
        "why": "pwd is the server's side."
      },
      {
        "text": "The site's own folder",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right. The account is locked inside it."
      },
      {
        "text": "A temporary folder for uploads",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "The upload went live at once."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
